<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - May 15.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - May 15.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>No closures of airports due to weather conditions are expected in the Commonwealth Independent States on May 15, the Russian Weather Service said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
